  "fullDescription": "Soak in the sunny, nostalgic vibes of paradise with Retro Beach! Inspired by 1970s coastal culture, retro surfboards, and warm tropical ocean breezes, this groovy handwritten display font brings an instant laid-back, sun-kissed energy to your creative work. Featuring soft rounded stems, playful organic curves, and a cheerful baseline, Retro Beach transforms every headline into a tropical retreat.\n\nRetro Beach is crafted with ultra-smooth vector lines, ensuring a fast, clean cutting and effortless weeding experience in major crafting software and cutting machines like Cricut and Silhouette.",
